    {
      "text": "It skillfully commands its grubs in battles with its enemies. The grubs are willing to risk their lives to defend Vespiquen.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Vespiquen that give off more pheromones have larger swarms of Combee attendants.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Commands its subjects to build its hive. It will dispatch any interlopers who dare sneak into its nest and use them as nourishment for itself.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
